From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Erhan Bilgili <erhan.bilgili@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 4 Jul 2026 08:43:08 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 25/49] winewayland.drv: Only grab owned menu popups.

Keep the owner-hint role and positioning logic intact, but restrict
xdg_popup_grab() to wayland_is_menu_popup(), i.e. popups with a live Win32
owner.

Fixes the pulldown menu regression that came with 9bf10ceefe1.
---
 dlls/winewayland.drv/wayland_surface.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/dlls/winewayland.drv/wayland_surface.c b/dlls/winewayland.drv/wayland_surface.c
index e6ad9bc8448..7c0281ecbdf 100644
--- a/dlls/winewayland.drv/wayland_surface.c
+++ b/dlls/winewayland.drv/wayland_surface.c
@@ -1329,7 +1329,7 @@ void wayland_surface_make_popup(struct wayland_surface *surface,
     if (!surface->xdg_popup) goto err;
     xdg_popup_add_listener(surface->xdg_popup, &xdg_popup_listener, surface->hwnd);
 
-    if (wayland_is_menu_popup_candidate(surface->hwnd))
+    if (wayland_is_menu_popup(surface->hwnd))
         grab_serial = popup_grab_serial_for_owner(owner);
     if (grab_serial)
     {
